                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Incredibly surprised at how enjoyable playing this game still is in 2026. I highly recommend this to any RPG enjoyer to this day. \r\n\r\nGame DOES need mods to run for modern PCs but all can be acquired on Steam Workshop in <5 mins and good to go. Mods that I used listed below. \r\n\r\nMods to run the game:\r\n- Union - patch for Gothic 2\r\n- FPS Improver\r\n- D3D11 Renderer Mod\r\n\r\nController support: \r\n- zGamePad - complete gamepad support",
